    "CoiStatement": "Bruce Thomas, Elizabeth Whally Buono, and Stacy Buchanan, as members of The Arcady Group, LLC, received a grant from the Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation to develop a TPP and to select a supplier for the development, manufacturing, and distribution of the MERM device. They have no continuing financial interest in the sale or use of the MERM devices. Sabina De Geest received support from The Arcady Group, LLC to assist in writing the proposal for this project. All other authors report no potential conflicts. All authors have submitted the ICMJE form for disclosure of potential conflicts of interest. Conflicts that the editors consider relevant to the content of the manuscript have been disclosed.",
